Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.86,0:00:11.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.07,0:00:13.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是你最喜欢的热巧克力。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.59,0:00:18.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（哈特）这里是……哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.20,0:00:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不记得了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.62,0:00:24.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们小时候曾在这栋别墅里度过。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊……我不记得了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.21,0:00:31.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那时候的你，总是笑着。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.91,0:00:36.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很爱说话也常开玩笑。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.49,0:00:44.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈特，把你变成这样的……。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.96,0:00:56.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（心园）打扰到你们了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.36,0:00:58.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧哈特，该工作了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.35,0:01:03.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心园先生哈特因为过度使用力量倒下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.90,0:01:07.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再继续使用哈特的力量的话……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.09,0:01:10.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗，这是费克博士大人的命令哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.64,0:01:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:14.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}讨厌……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.68,0:01:18.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不为大伙儿着想的哥哥，我最讨厌了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.04,0:01:19.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阳斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.10,0:01:21.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我无所谓。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.07,0:01:24.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果我的力量能为了这个世界派上用场{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.94,0:01:27.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就不需要为我担心了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.97,0:01:29.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阳斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.99,0:01:32.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太棒了，阳斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.20,0:01:35.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}菲卡博士大人也一定会很高兴的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.88,0:01:40.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗，你也是，如果真的想治好阳斗的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.43,0:01:44.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就一天也好，尽早把所有的 No.卡都收集齐吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.07,0:01:56.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）哎～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.26,0:01:58.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔啊！好痛痛痛……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.95,0:02:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等！这个皇之键里面有飞船？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.00,0:02:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.26,0:02:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这么小的钥匙里面？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.03,0:02:10.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来 那把钥匙似乎并不是这个世界的产物。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.90,0:02:13.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你父亲所持有的那把钥匙里{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.43,0:02:15.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}隐藏着许多谜团。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.96,0:02:19.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 那艘飞行船真的能飞起来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.32,0:02:22.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}飞行船 是由如同巨大拼图一般的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.83,0:02:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构造组成的。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.70,0:02:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要解开那个拼图就需要 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.62,0:02:35.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐怕当所有 No.都集齐的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.49,0:02:38.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那艘飞行船就会…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.01,0:02:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.99,0:02:56.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}轨道！ 重新开始 No.狩猎。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.70,0:02:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说明情况。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.67,0:02:59.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鼾声）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.89,0:03:01.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}轨道… 轨道7！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.92,0:03:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（轨道7）噫～！ 遵 遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.45,0:03:07.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快……快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.36,0:03:08.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.31,0:03:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}持有 No.卡的决斗者的情报分析
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.50,0:03:13.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经做好了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.19,0:03:15.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃……那个……那个……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.21,0:03:17.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我最讨厌无能的人了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.91,0:03:20.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是无能之辈吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.26,0:03:22.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵命 遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.30,0:03:25.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}求您千万别把我报废掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.14,0:03:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去找出 No.卡的原版。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.83,0:03:28.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原版？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.50,0:03:30.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊。Dr.费卡说过{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.37,0:03:32.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把 No.卡带到这个世界的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.97,0:03:34.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使者是存在的。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.74,0:03:37.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙……原版必定
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.14,0:03:39.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}附身在某个人身上。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.63,0:03:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原版。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.32,0:03:46.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么快斗大人我发现了一样有点在意的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.20,0:03:51.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是前几天对战过的 No.决斗者——
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.06,0:03:53.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马身上戴着的奇怪的吊坠。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.76,0:03:55.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.62,0:03:59.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个不是这个世界的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.15,0:04:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？那时候的决斗者吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.21,0:04:05.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.78,0:04:08.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}立刻去收集这家伙的情报。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.75,0:04:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵、遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.60,0:04:13.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《九十九游马吗……》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.64,0:05:51.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了～！今天的体育课是游泳课我忘了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.02,0:05:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.78,0:05:53.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的……真是个忙活的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.89,0:05:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（右京）我放心了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.57,0:05:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你愿意来学校了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.79,0:06:05.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是游马改变了你的心吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.67,0:06:08.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他有着如太阳般不可思议的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.20,0:06:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不知为何，与游马扯上关系的人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.90,0:06:15.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不知不觉间自己的内心就会被照亮。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.27,0:06:17.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你不这么觉得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.76,0:06:19.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁知道呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.47,0:06:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呐 今天游马君会不会也热血冲一把呢。不好说呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.84,0:06:24.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真让人期待呀。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.15,0:06:25.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）嘛…算是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.87,0:06:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.60,0:06:28.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.90,0:06:31.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游泳的时候戴吊坠是禁止的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.76,0:06:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.45,0:06:37.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔唔唔～ 那 说到底就是因为很危险！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.82,0:06:39.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才不危险呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.08,0:06:41.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯西）凯特也 这么认为。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.86,0:06:43.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呐 游马 你看上次也是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.89,0:06:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就那样戴着它跳进泳池
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.46,0:06:48.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结果扎进头里了不是吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.93,0:06:50.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.45,0:06:53.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈？扎进去了？扎进谁的头里了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.04,0:06:53.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀～。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.82,0:06:57.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔唔唔！是我的头啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.54,0:07:01.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的 那个委员长…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.53,0:07:03.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是个记仇的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.42,0:07:06.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说回来 星光体那家伙…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.28,0:07:09.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的 就进了这么小不点的钥匙里面吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.65,0:07:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛 好好看家吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.23,0:07:23.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如同太阳一般拥有不可思议的力量… 吗 呵。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.51,0:07:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被当成废品处理掉我可不要。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.55,0:07:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个吊坠里一定藏着秘密。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.46,0:07:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我记忆的碎片 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.30,0:07:47.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经回收的枚数　达到了１０枚。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.41,0:07:57.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的　这段记忆　到底是什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.46,0:08:00.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行…　想不起来。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.16,0:08:05.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必须收集更多的 No.卡才行。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.03,0:08:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这里的说。　找的说。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.45,0:08:16.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确认目标！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.81,0:08:19.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么　收下的说。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.85,0:08:21.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}任务完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.87,0:08:22.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.52,0:08:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙　在干什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.56,0:08:25.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那…　那个
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.68,0:08:28.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把…　把那项链还回来的说。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.94,0:08:30.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不然我就要　被报废了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.62,0:08:33.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说什么莫名其妙的话！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.99,0:08:36.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕嘿～！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.51,0:08:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你竟敢这样！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.28,0:08:41.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔唔唔…　既然如此！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.06,0:08:44.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那条项链绝对　要你还回来的说！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.43,0:08:49.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就赌我们俩其中一方会变成废铁吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.64,0:08:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事！？这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.33,0:08:54.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看招！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.38,0:08:58.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}偷瞄。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.60,0:09:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.84,0:09:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？锁正在停下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.42,0:09:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}设置好的 No.……被解除了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.80,0:09:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}皇之钥被封锁了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.45,0:09:39.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把那吊坠交出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.97,0:09:41.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.16,0:09:43.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到此为止了，轨道！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.04,0:09:47.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟敢擅自乱来……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.88,0:09:48.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:50.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你拿着的那条吊坠
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.99,0:09:52.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就交给我吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.61,0:09:53.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我拒绝！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.59,0:09:56.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这可不是你的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.81,0:09:57.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.29,0:09:58.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是九十九游马的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.17,0:10:00.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你认识游马？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.52,0:10:04.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，那家伙因为他持有 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.89,0:10:08.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡……原来如此你这家伙就是 No.猎人！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.60,0:10:10.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦？你认识我啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.66,0:10:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，你也把 No.卡……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.31,0:10:15.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果我说我有呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.84,0:10:18.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那对我来说正好。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.86,0:10:21.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡和那条挂坠
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.75,0:10:24.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我全都要了！决斗吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.76,0:10:31.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马……看来我该还你人情的时候到了啊》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.16,0:10:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思！我接受挑战！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.22,0:10:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗模式 光子变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.25,0:10:43.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.95,0:10:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼）决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.06,0:10:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D·凝视者 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.62,0:11:04.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，让我来狩猎吧连同你的灵魂一起！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.20,0:11:11.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR视界链接 完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.43,0:11:13.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.59,0:11:14.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太过分了……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.69,0:11:16.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特被弄得乱七八糟。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.78,0:11:19.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）到底是谁干的？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.14,0:11:21.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总而言之这根本不是人能做到的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.50,0:11:24.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有……没有 没有 没有！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.52,0:11:27.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}皇之钥不见了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.05,0:11:29.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻归我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.74,0:11:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.11,0:11:35.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《那家伙如果是 No.猎人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.80,0:11:38.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相当数量的 No.应该持有。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.16,0:11:41.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 我有打倒 No.的秘策》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.86,0:11:44.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将手牌中的大鲨鱼送入墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.56,0:11:48.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌中发动永续魔法 鲨鱼领域！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.10,0:11:50.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要这张卡的效果存在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.12,0:11:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我送去墓地的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.22,0:11:54.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力以下的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.32,0:11:55.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无法攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.58,0:11:59.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大颚鲨的攻击力是 1800！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.03,0:12:01.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 你所使用的 1800以下的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.60,0:12:03.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽的攻击就被封印了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.58,0:12:07.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且我还要 召唤鲨章鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.46,0:12:08.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨章鱼）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.63,0:12:10.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鲨鲨～鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.15,0:12:11.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.13,0:12:14.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 盖放1张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.36,0:12:17.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《来吧 呼唤 No.卡吧！》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.09,0:12:23.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.45,0:12:27.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动魔法卡融合！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.15,0:12:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}融合！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.00,0:12:32.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌将2只光子蜥蜴融合！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.20,0:12:35.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将指定的素材送入墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.90,0:12:37.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从额外卡组
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.78,0:12:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤融合怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.78,0:12:41.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}融合召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.86,0:12:44.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 双生光子蜥蜴！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.99,0:12:47.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《的确 如果是融合召唤的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.52,0:12:50.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从一开始就能唤出强力的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.88,0:12:53.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 不用超量召唤而是用融合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.75,0:12:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙 是能自由运用一切战术吗！？》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.12,0:12:59.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）你的魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.15,0:13:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对攻击力1800以下的怪兽有效。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.00,0:13:05.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种限制 对我可不管用。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.03,0:13:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！双生光子蜥蜴！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.06,0:13:11.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}崇高吐息！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.62,0:13:17.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 就在这个瞬间阴影章鱼的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.82,0:13:19.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将沙克塔帕斯通过战斗破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.80,0:13:21.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为对方怪兽的装备卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.70,0:13:24.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那只怪兽的攻击力变为０！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.89,0:13:27.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且被附身的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.25,0:13:29.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}表示形式无法改变。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.44,0:13:33.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 你的怪兽会以攻击力０
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:34.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}留在场上！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.99,0:13:36.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下形势逆转了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.18,0:13:39.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下个回合我要给你造成大量伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.21,0:13:43.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔唔唔… 这家伙意外地还挺能干的嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.07,0:13:45.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的会那么顺利吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.73,0:13:46.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.61,0:13:49.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动双光子蜥蜴的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.97,0:13:52.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽在融合召唤时使用的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.00,0:13:53.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}素材存在于墓地时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.35,0:13:57.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以解除融合。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.41,0:14:03.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《等级3的怪兽有2只要来了吗！？》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.45,0:14:05.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）我用等级3的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.15,0:14:07.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子蜥蜴2只进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.34,0:14:11.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.23,0:14:13.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.21,0:14:16.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.62,0:14:24.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！No.30！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.32,0:14:27.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用那令人厌恶的力量将一切溶解殆尽！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.69,0:14:30.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破灭的酸液石人！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.24,0:14:35.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《鲨鱼：攻击力3000！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.17,0:14:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙就是那人的 No.……》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.99,0:14:44.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《哼，绝佳的猎物上钩了》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.69,0:14:47.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！飞溅捕获！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.57,0:14:52.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在对方超量召唤时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.60,0:14:55.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己墓地的鱼族怪兽2只除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.13,0:14:58.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}获得对方怪兽超量怪兽的控制权。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.33,0:15:00.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从墓地把大颚鲨和
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.73,0:15:02.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}章鱼鲨除外！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.21,0:15:05.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼）上钩了啊，No.猎人。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.57,0:15:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的目标就是让你召唤出
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.94,0:15:10.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}强力的怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.16,0:15:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，酸液魔像的控制权
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.50,0:15:20.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就归我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.63,0:15:24.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我夺过来的是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.49,0:15:26.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力3000的超强力 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.84,0:15:28.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗，我拿下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.53,0:15:29.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.37,0:15:31.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下不妙了吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.05,0:15:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你给我退下。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.04,0:15:34.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}噫……遵命。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.92,0:15:37.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡 强制解放！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.29,0:15:40.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以把场上的超量怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.59,0:15:42.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只的超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.67,0:15:45.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部送去墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.03,0:15:48.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖下一张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.23,0:15:49.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.84,0:15:51.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被消灭了吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.09,0:15:55.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，只要还有3000的攻击力……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.36,0:15:57.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.82,0:15:59.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼……就在这一刻，我要让你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.85,0:16:02.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}承受酸液魔像的诅咒。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.20,0:16:04.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}诅咒！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.39,0:16:07.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗷～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.61,0:16:14.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜……呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.49,0:16:16.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）酸液魔像
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.56,0:16:18.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是自灭型的 No.卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.36,0:16:22.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然只有阶级3，却拥有攻击力3000{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.06,0:16:24.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种破格的能力作为代价{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.42,0:16:27.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}它的身上被施加了好几道诅咒。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.95,0:16:29.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.47,0:16:32.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其中一道是每当你的回合到来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.33,0:16:35.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量单元如果不使用一个的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.86,0:16:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就会受到２０００点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.22,0:16:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…！　但是　酸液魔像的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.78,0:16:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力　还活着！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.28,0:16:44.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！　酸液魔像！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.93,0:16:46.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.15,0:16:47.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没用的。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.41,0:16:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.67,0:16:52.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}酸液魔像　如果没有超量单元
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.06,0:16:54.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的话　就无法攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.04,0:16:55.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什　什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.39,0:16:57.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你　使用魔法卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.75,0:16:59.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想让我召唤出强力的 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.83,0:17:01.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这件事　我早就知道了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.63,0:17:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}中了陷阱的是…　我！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.33,0:17:07.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这样下去的话　会因为酸液魔像的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.37,0:17:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果自灭…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.53,0:17:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.猎人…　这家伙强得离谱。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.58,0:17:16.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样 要输了吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.32,0:17:24.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是这样没错…… 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.21,0:17:29.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 盖一张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.24,0:17:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.76,0:17:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我现在盖下的卡是 踢回·生命。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.96,0:17:38.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在自己的回合 自己受到效果伤害的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.16,0:17:40.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个伤害无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.18,0:17:42.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}应该还有胜机……。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.20,0:17:44.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 绝对不会放弃！》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.56,0:17:46.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.58,0:17:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子·升华！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.43,0:17:52.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 通过将墓地的光子怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.16,0:17:53.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}２体除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.48,0:17:55.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽２张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.50,0:17:59.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 光子蜥蜴２体除外！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.53,0:18:00.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽２张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.96,0:18:01.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼……。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.73,0:18:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 特殊召唤光子斩击者！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.93,0:18:07.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子斩击者在 自己场上有{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.95,0:18:09.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当场上没有怪兽时可以特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.47,0:18:13.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着 将光子粉碎者通常召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.22,0:18:20.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！ 我将这2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.83,0:18:23.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解放 特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.11,0:18:25.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底要召唤什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.15,0:18:27.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.80,0:18:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽不能通常召唤{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.84,0:18:33.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解放攻击力2000以上的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.44,0:18:34.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才能特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.24,0:18:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.78,0:18:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）光之化身 此刻 降临。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.99,0:18:47.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.55,0:18:51.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）现身吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.75,0:18:53.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼光子龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.91,0:18:56.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗷～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.27,0:18:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.25,0:18:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（雷鸣）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.30,0:19:01.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.09,0:19:03.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.70,0:19:07.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.36,0:19:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是什么云啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.23,0:19:11.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说…… 唔。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.51,0:19:12.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.14,0:19:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}外面的世界发生了什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.17,0:19:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.37,0:19:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当该来之时到来之际
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.36,0:19:28.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}便能获得泽阿尔的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.93,0:19:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将一切黑暗化为光明的力量泽阿尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.18,0:19:40.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事？那只怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.88,0:19:42.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到此为止了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.88,0:19:45.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破灭的光子流。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.48,0:19:52.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！竟然攻击 No.怪兽？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.70,0:19:58.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.23,0:20:01.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能。银河眼又不是 No.怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.26,0:20:03.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么能破坏 No.怪兽？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.80,0:20:07.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材没有了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.74,0:20:10.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}酸液魔像受到攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.18,0:20:13.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会被无条件破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.08,0:20:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.88,0:20:17.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 刚才那下攻击是你的操作失误吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.92,0:20:20.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为从酸液魔像的诅咒中
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.28,0:20:22.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把我给救出来了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.63,0:20:24.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈 你说我失误？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.88,0:20:27.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是个浪漫主义者啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.35,0:20:28.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.02,0:20:30.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}诅咒还没有结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.07,0:20:32.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}酸液魔像被破坏的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.90,0:20:34.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予其控制者
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.42,0:20:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}２０００点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.79,0:20:41.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.57,0:20:54.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔噢～。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.62,0:20:56.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔哈。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.38,0:21:06.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.91,0:21:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我来猎取吧。 连同你的灵魂一起。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.15,0:21:16.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔哇！ 啊啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.56,0:21:25.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？ 这个灵魂里 没有 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.76,0:21:28.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.63,0:21:30.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.55,0:21:32.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.69,0:21:39.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.06,0:21:41.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你到底想干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.59,0:21:45.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人，目前光子模式下的负荷已达85%。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.80,0:21:47.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再继续决斗的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.57,0:21:48.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.49,0:21:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是皇之键。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.66,0:22:08.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.41,0:22:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又要来啦特别企划 第2弹。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.99,0:22:24.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家喜欢的 No.卡是？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.76,0:24:01.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次介绍7张。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.80,0:24:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下次介绍剩下的6张。

